@startuml
title Ocelot GNN DOP: **Architecture & Forward Pass**

!theme vibrant

skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam defaultFontColor Black
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Input Data" {
  [Input HeteroData Object] as HeteroData
  note right of HeteroData
    Features and graph structure:
    - Node types: `*_input`, `mesh`,
    `*_target`
    - Edge types: [(*, to, mesh)],
    [(mesh, to, mesh)], [(mesh, to, *)]
  end note
}

package "Model Components" {
    left to right direction
    component "Encoder" {
        [Observation Embedders\n(MLP for each input type)] as EncoderMLPs
        [Aggregate to Mesh\n(scatter_add)] as EncoderAgg
    }

    component "Processor" {
        [Mesh GNN\n(N x InteractionNetwork Layers)] as MeshProcessor
    }

    component "Decoder" {
        [Aggregate from Mesh\n(scatter_mean)] as DecoderAgg
        [Output Mappers\n(MLP for each target type)] as DecoderMLPs
    }
}


package "Output " {
  [Prediaacted Observations] as Output
}


' --- Data Flow Connections ---

HeteroData --> EncoderMLPs : `*_input` node features
note on link: Each input observation type \nis processed by its own MLP embedder.

EncoderMLPs --> EncoderAgg : Embedded Features
HeteroData --> EncoderAgg : [(*_input, to, mesh)] edges
note on link: Encoded features are sent to \n the mesh nodes they are connected to.

EncoderAgg --> MeshProcessor : Initial Mesh Node Features

MeshProcessor --> MeshProcessor : [(mesh, to, mesh)] edges
note on link: Information is propagated \n across the mesh for N steps.

MeshProcessor --> DecoderAgg : Processed Mesh Features
HeteroData -left-> DecoderAgg : [(mesh, to, *_target)] edges
note on link: Target nodes gather features from their connected mesh nodes.

DecoderAgg --> DecoderMLPs : Aggregated Features per Target

DecoderMLPs -left-> Output : Final Predictions

@enduml


@startuml
title Ocelot GNN: Data Flow and Processing

skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam defaultFontColor Black

start
:Load Raw Time-Series Data from Zarr;
note right: Contains multiple observation types\n(satellite, surface, etc.)

:Slice data into discrete **Time Bins**;
note right: Creates Input -> Target sample pairs

partition "For Each Bin" {
    :Extract Features & Metadata;
    note right
        - Normalize core features (StandardScaler)
        - Generate cyclical time/space features (features_aux)
    endnote

:Handle Missing Values (NaNs);
note right
    1. Create binary **mask** for `features_norm` & `features_meta`
    2. Impute NaNs with 0
    endnote
}

partition "GNN Model Forward Pass" {
    split
        partition "Encoder" {
            :Project Observation Features onto Mesh Nodes;
            note right: An MLP processes each observation, then\n`scatter_add` aggregates features onto the mesh.
        }
    split again
        partition "Processor" {
            :Perform N steps of Message Passing\non the **Mesh Graph**;
            note right: Interaction Networks learn\nglobal spatial dynamics.
        }
    split again
        partition "Decoder" {
            :Map Processed Mesh Features\nto Target Observation Locations;
            note right: Gathers from nearest mesh nodes\nand predicts with an MLP.
        }
    end split
}

partition "Graph Construction" {
    :Assemble **PyG HeteroData Object**;
    note right
      - **Nodes**: obs_input, mesh, obs_target
      - **Features**: Concatenate [imputed_features, mask]
      - **Edges**: obs->mesh, mesh->mesh, mesh->target
    endnote
}

partition "Training" {
    :Generate Predictions;
    :Calculate **Masked Loss**;
    note right: Compares predictions to ground truth,\nignoring loss from any missing **target** values.
    :Update Model Weights;
}

stop

@enduml
